[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer/HBoxContainer/Objective Panel"]
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Level: Variable Addition[/font_size][/b]

[b]Objective:[/b]
We need to run the [color=#a020f0]makeSmoothie()[/color] function. It requires two ingredients to work.

[b]The Java Code:[/b]
First, we name our ingredients (variables). Then, we add them together.

[code]
// 1. Define the ingredients
String fruitA = [color=#ff5555]\"Strawberry\"[/color];
String fruitB = [color=#5555ff]\"Blueberry\"[/color];

// 2. Mix them together!
String smoothie = [color=#ff5555]fruitA[/color] + [color=#5555ff]fruitB[/color];
[/code]

[b]The Result:[/b]
The computer combines the Red and Blue data to create [color=#a020f0]Purple[/color].

[b]Your Turn:[/b]
Connect the [color=#ff5555]Red Node[/color] and [color=#5555ff]Blue Node[/color] to the mixer to execute this code!"

